1253	/* 盘面几何：d=140（原 160）。缩盘 + 模式名外移到 r=99，给扇区/舵柄留出
1254	 * 安全距；盘下 226..290 让给本周数据。 */
1255	#define DIAL_CX 120
1256	#define DIAL_CY 138
1257	#define DIAL_D  140
1258	
1259	/* 盘下常驻：本周里程/次数 + 7 根迷你柱。柱与记录页同一套画法：
1260	 * 8px 宽、12px 间距、0 值 P_TRACK、其余 C_DEEP[M_RECORD]、圆角 1。 */
1261	static void dial_week_strip(void)
1262	{
1263	    char buf[48];
1264	    double mx = 1.0;
1265	
1266	    for (int i = 0; i < 7; i++) {
1267	        if (s_week[i] > mx) mx = s_week[i];
1268	    }
1269	    snprintf(buf, sizeof(buf), "本周 %.1f %s · %d 次",
1270	             conv_dist(week_total()), unit_dist(), week_rides());
1271	    (void)LW(s_scr, buf, PX_SMALL, P_INK, 0, 248, 240, LV_TEXT_ALIGN_CENTER);
1272	    for (int i = 0; i < 7; i++) {
1273	        int h = (int)((s_week[i] * 18.0) / mx);
1274	
1275	        if (h < 2) h = 2;
1276	        (void)B(s_scr, 80 + i * 12, 284 - h, 8, h,
1277	                s_week[i] == 0 ? P_TRACK : C_DEEP[M_RECORD], LV_OPA_COVER, 1);
1278	    }
1279	}
